# POST /api/sheets/{sheetId}/claims/{claimId}/remind — remind an OPEN or PENDING claim: its reminded date becomes the
# sheet's today and REMIND is written. Refused with 422 for a claim in any other status, or one already reminded on the
# sheet's today; nothing is stored. 404 for a claim not on the sheet. With an escalation gap set (escalate-after), a
# reminder at least that many days after the claim's previous one escalates it, once per claim ever: ESCALATE is
# written after REMIND.
